  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>This small, handheld gadget allows the user to unleash a barrage of bullets made out of pure force.</p>\n<p>This gun has 7 charges. While holding it, you can use an action to expend 1 or more charges to use the Missiles creation. For 1 charge, you cast the 1st-level version. You can increase the creation slot level by one for each additional charge.</p>\n<p>The gun regains 1d6 + 1 expended charges daily at dawn. If you expend the last charge, roll a d20. On a 1, the gun becomes unsalvageable.</p>",
